WEBVTT

00:04:57.038 --> 00:05:00.704
Despite these challenges,
I'm super excited about alien microbes

00:05:00.746 --> 00:05:02.288
and what they could teach us.

00:05:02.329 --> 00:05:04.996
Even if we find just one
other sign of life,

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:07.579
then likely the universe
is teeming with it,

00:05:07.579 --> 00:05:10.246
from single-celled to complex.

00:05:10.246 --> 00:05:13.329
If we search for decades and find nothing,

00:05:13.371 --> 00:05:15.413
then that is equally humbling.

00:05:15.413 --> 00:05:16.913
But we must try.

00:05:16.954 --> 00:05:22.746
We must do this search even when it means
sitting with uncertainty along the way.

00:05:22.746 --> 00:05:23.954
Thank you.